<title>AUSTRIA: Austria Natl bank allots 9.98 bln ATS in repos.</title>
<headline>Austria Natl bank allots 9.98 bln ATS in repos.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Austrian National Bank said on Friday it had allocated 9.98 billion schillings in one-week securities repurchase agreements, or repos, at an unchanged three percent.</p>
<p>The central bank said 11 percent of bids were filled.</p>
<p>Last week, the bank allotted 9.8 billion schillings, or 12 percent of bids, in repos. -- Julia Ferguson, Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12 274</p>
